<template name="config-menu__jfg_visuals">
    <head>
    </head>
    <body>
        <form class="config__form">
            <div class="config__hz-wrapper">
                <!-- Options (generated by tools/gen_jfg_config_rml.py) -->
                <div class="config__wrapper" data-event-mouseout="set_cur_config_index(-1)" style="overflow-y: auto; height: 100%;">

                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Display</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(0)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Widescreen</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_widescreen" data-checked="widescreen" value="1" id="jfg_widescreen_on" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_visuals; nav-down: #jfg_fov_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_widescreen_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(0)" name="jfg_widescreen" data-checked="widescreen" value="0" id="jfg_widescreen_off" style="nav-up: #tab_jfg_visuals; nav-down: #jfg_fov_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_widescreen_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(1)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Field of View</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{fov}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(1)" id="jfg_fov_input" type="range" min="75" max="140" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_widescreen_on; nav-down: #jfg_frame_rate_0;" data-value="fov"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(2)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Frame Rate</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="0" id="jfg_frame_rate_0" style="nav-up: #jfg_fov_input; nav-down: #jfg_interp_limit_0;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_0">Original</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="1" id="jfg_frame_rate_1" style="nav-up: #jfg_fov_input; nav-down: #jfg_interp_limit_90;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_1">60</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(2)" name="jfg_frame_rate" data-checked="frame_rate" value="2" id="jfg_frame_rate_2" style="nav-up: #jfg_fov_input; nav-down: #jfg_interp_limit_120;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_frame_rate_2">60 + Interpolated</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(3)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Interpolation Limit</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="0" id="jfg_interp_limit_0" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_0; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_0">Monitor</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="90" id="jfg_interp_limit_90" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_1; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_90">90</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="120" id="jfg_interp_limit_120" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_2; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_120">120</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="144" id="jfg_interp_limit_144" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_2; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_144">144</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="165" id="jfg_interp_limit_165" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_2; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_165">165</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(3)" name="jfg_interp_limit" data-checked="interp_limit" value="240" id="jfg_interp_limit_240" style="nav-up: #jfg_frame_rate_2; nav-down: #jfg_hit_flash_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_interp_limit_240">240</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(4)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Hit Flash Opacity</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{hit_flash}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(4)" id="jfg_hit_flash_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_interp_limit_0; nav-down: #jfg_hide_floyd_on;" data-value="hit_flash"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(5)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Hide Floyd</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_hide_floyd" data-checked="hide_floyd" value="1" id="jfg_hide_floyd_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_hit_flash_input; nav-down: #jfg_no_lod_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_hide_floyd_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(5)" name="jfg_hide_floyd" data-checked="hide_floyd" value="0" id="jfg_hide_floyd_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_hit_flash_input; nav-down: #jfg_no_lod_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_hide_floyd_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(6)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Disable LOD</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_no_lod" data-checked="no_lod" value="1" id="jfg_no_lod_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_hide_floyd_on; nav-down: #jfg_far_objects_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_lod_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(6)" name="jfg_no_lod" data-checked="no_lod" value="0" id="jfg_no_lod_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_hide_floyd_off; nav-down: #jfg_far_objects_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_lod_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(7)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Draw Distant Objects</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" name="jfg_far_objects" data-checked="far_objects" value="1" id="jfg_far_objects_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_lod_on; nav-down: #jfg_show_fps_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_far_objects_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(7)" name="jfg_far_objects" data-checked="far_objects" value="0" id="jfg_far_objects_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_lod_off; nav-down: #jfg_show_fps_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_far_objects_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(8)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Show FPS</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" name="jfg_show_fps" data-checked="show_fps" value="1" id="jfg_show_fps_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_far_objects_on; nav-down: #jfg_show_level_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_fps_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(8)" name="jfg_show_fps" data-checked="show_fps" value="0" id="jfg_show_fps_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_far_objects_off; nav-down: #jfg_show_level_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_fps_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(9)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Show Level</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_show_level" data-checked="show_level" value="1" id="jfg_show_level_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_show_fps_on; nav-down: #jfg_fly_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_level_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(9)" name="jfg_show_level" data-checked="show_level" value="0" id="jfg_show_level_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_show_fps_off; nav-down: #jfg_fly_speed_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_show_level_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Fly Camera (F7)</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(10)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Fly Speed</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{fly_speed}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(10)" id="jfg_fly_speed_input" type="range" min="10" max="1000" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_show_level_on; nav-down: #jfg_fly_freeze_on;" data-value="fly_speed"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(11)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Freeze While Flying</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" name="jfg_fly_freeze" data-checked="fly_freeze" value="1" id="jfg_fly_freeze_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(11)" name="jfg_fly_freeze" data-checked="fly_freeze" value="0" id="jfg_fly_freeze_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_speed_input; nav-down: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_freeze_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(12)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Hide HUD While Flying</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(12)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="1" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_freeze_on; nav-down: #jfg_ssao_on;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(12)" name="jfg_fly_hide_hud" data-checked="fly_hide_hud" value="0" id="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_freeze_off; nav-down: #jfg_ssao_off;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_fly_hide_hud_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Ambient Occlusion</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(13)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Ambient Occlusion (SSAO)</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_ssao" data-checked="ssao" value="1" id="jfg_ssao_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_on; nav-down: #jfg_ssao_strength_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_ssao_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(13)" name="jfg_ssao" data-checked="ssao" value="0" id="jfg_ssao_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_fly_hide_hud_off; nav-down: #jfg_ssao_strength_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_ssao_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(14)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">SSAO Strength</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{ssao_strength}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(14)" id="jfg_ssao_strength_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_ssao_on; nav-down: #jfg_ssao_radius_input;" data-value="ssao_strength"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(15)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">SSAO Radius</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{ssao_radius}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(15)" id="jfg_ssao_radius_input" type="range" min="10" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_ssao_strength_input; nav-down: #jfg_bloom_on;" data-value="ssao_radius"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Bloom</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(16)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" name="jfg_bloom" data-checked="bloom" value="1" id="jfg_bloom_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_ssao_radius_input; nav-down: #jfg_bloom_intensity_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_bloom_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(16)" name="jfg_bloom" data-checked="bloom" value="0" id="jfg_bloom_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_ssao_radius_input; nav-down: #jfg_bloom_intensity_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_bloom_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(17)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Intensity</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_intensity}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(17)" id="jfg_bloom_intensity_input" type="range" min="0" max="300" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_bloom_on; nav-down: #jfg_bloom_threshold_input;" data-value="bloom_intensity"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(18)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Threshold</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_threshold}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(18)" id="jfg_bloom_threshold_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_bloom_intensity_input; nav-down: #jfg_bloom_radius_input;" data-value="bloom_threshold"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(19)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Bloom Radius</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{bloom_radius}}</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(19)" id="jfg_bloom_radius_input" type="range" min="1" max="20" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_bloom_threshold_input; nav-down: #jfg_vignette_on;" data-value="bloom_radius"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Vignette</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(20)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Vignette</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(20)" name="jfg_vignette" data-checked="vignette" value="1" id="jfg_vignette_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_bloom_radius_input; nav-down: #jfg_vignette_strength_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_vignette_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(20)" name="jfg_vignette" data-checked="vignette" value="0" id="jfg_vignette_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_bloom_radius_input; nav-down: #jfg_vignette_strength_input;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_vignette_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(21)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Vignette Strength</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{vignette_strength}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(21)" id="jfg_vignette_strength_input" type="range" min="0" max="100" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_vignette_on; nav-down: #jfg_vignette_size_input;" data-value="vignette_strength"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(22)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Vignette Size</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{vignette_size}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(22)" id="jfg_vignette_size_input" type="range" min="0" max="90" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_vignette_strength_input; nav-down: #jfg_level_fog_distance_input;" data-value="vignette_size"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Fog</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(23)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Level Fog Distance</label>
                        <div class="config-option__range-wrapper config-option__list">
                            <label class="config-option__range-label">{{level_fog_distance}}%</label>
                            <input class="nav-vert" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(23)" id="jfg_level_fog_distance_input" type="range" min="50" max="400" style="flex: 1; margin: 0dp; nav-up: #jfg_vignette_size_input; nav-down: #jfg_no_level_fog_on;" data-value="level_fog_distance"/>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(24)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">No Level Fog</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(24)" name="jfg_no_level_fog" data-checked="no_level_fog" value="1" id="jfg_no_level_fog_on" style="nav-up: #jfg_level_fog_distance_input; nav-down: #jfg_texture_filter_0;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_level_fog_on">On</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(24)" name="jfg_no_level_fog" data-checked="no_level_fog" value="0" id="jfg_no_level_fog_off" style="nav-up: #jfg_level_fog_distance_input; nav-down: #jfg_texture_filter_1;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_no_level_fog_off">Off</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" style="margin: 24dp 0dp 0dp;"><label class="config-option__title config-group__title">Filtering</label></div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(25)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Texture Filtering</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(25)" name="jfg_texture_filter" data-checked="texture_filter" value="0" id="jfg_texture_filter_0" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_level_fog_on; nav-down: #jfg_output_filter_0;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_texture_filter_0">N64 Three-Point</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(25)" name="jfg_texture_filter" data-checked="texture_filter" value="1" id="jfg_texture_filter_1" style="nav-up: #jfg_no_level_fog_off; nav-down: #jfg_output_filter_1;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_texture_filter_1">Bilinear</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="config-option" data-event-mouseover="set_cur_config_index(26)">
                        <label class="config-option__title">Picture Scaling</label>
                        <div class="config-option__list">
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(26)" name="jfg_output_filter" data-checked="output_filter" value="0" id="jfg_output_filter_0" style="nav-up: #jfg_texture_filter_0; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_output_filter_0">Anti-Aliased</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(26)" name="jfg_output_filter" data-checked="output_filter" value="1" id="jfg_output_filter_1" style="nav-up: #jfg_texture_filter_1; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_output_filter_1">Linear</label>
                            <input type="radio" data-event-blur="set_cur_config_index(-1)" data-event-focus="set_cur_config_index(26)" name="jfg_output_filter" data-checked="output_filter" value="2" id="jfg_output_filter_2" style="nav-up: #jfg_texture_filter_1; nav-down: none;"/>
                            <label class="config-option__tab-label" for="jfg_output_filter_2">Nearest</label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <!-- Descriptions -->
                <div class="config__wrapper">
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 0">During gameplay the 3D view fills the window; the HUD stays in the middle. Things at the far left and right may appear late.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 1">Widens or narrows the view during gameplay, relative to each level's own field of view. Cutscenes, menus, the pause screen and zoomed scopes keep the game's own.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 2"><b>Original</b>: 30, dropping to 20 like the N64. <b>60</b>: the game updates every video frame; game speed stays the same. <b>60 + Interpolated</b>: the renderer also adds in-between frames up to your monitor's refresh rate; some moving objects may look off.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 3">With <b>60 + Interpolated</b>: the most frames a second the renderer makes. <b>Monitor</b>: your monitor's refresh rate. A lower limit takes less from the graphics card (try it if the frame rate is uneven in a large or maximized window). Motion is smoothest when the limit is a multiple of 60 (120, 240) and at most your monitor's rate.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 4">How strongly the screen turns red when your character is hit. 100% is the original game; 0% turns the red flash off.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 5">Floyd, his shadow and his sounds are gone while he follows your character; he still flies along and shoots. Floyd missions and a second player flying him show him as usual.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 6">Characters and objects keep their full-detail model at any distance.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 7">Objects no longer fade out and disappear beyond their draw distance. Level scenery itself is not affected.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 8">The game's frame rate in the top right corner.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 9">The level number and name in the top right corner.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 10">F7 (or F10 > Tools) flies a free camera for screenshots: WASD / left stick move where it looks, mouse / right stick look, Space / A up, Ctrl / B down, holding fire flies faster. F7 again ends it.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 11">The game stands still while the fly camera is on (enemies, effects and the level stop as when paused).</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 12">The health meter and the rest of the HUD are hidden while the fly camera is on.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 13">Darkens creases, corners and the ground around objects, worked out from the depth of the 3D view. The HUD is not affected.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 14">How dark the ambient occlusion gets.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 15">How far around a surface ambient occlusion looks, in game units.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 16">Bright parts of the 3D view (lights, explosions, sky, shots) glow softly into their surroundings. The HUD does not glow.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 17">How strong the glow is.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 18">How bright a colour must be to glow. Lower: more of the picture glows.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 19">How far the glow spreads.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 20">Darkens the edges and corners of the 3D view. The HUD is not darkened.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 21">How dark the corners get.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 22">How far from the middle the darkening starts: higher keeps more of the picture clear.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 23">How far away the levels' own fog is. Some levels use it to hide where the scenery stops being drawn, so moving it back can show things appearing in the distance.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 24">Turns the levels' own fog off. Things in the distance may be seen appearing.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 25"><b>N64 Three-Point</b>: how the N64 smooths textures. <b>Bilinear</b>: smoother, as on PC.</p>
                    <p data-if="cur_config_index == 26">How the picture is scaled to the window. <b>Anti-Aliased</b>: sharp pixels with smooth edges. <b>Linear</b>: softer. <b>Nearest</b>: sharp pixels.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </body>
</template>
